<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="a8281640">As the risks are identified and marked in the to-be business process flows, begin documenting existing or new controls that
can be assigned to mitigate those risks in a risk and controls matrix (RACM) artifact. Capture any automated controls, IT
